  "title": "Tzatziki Sauce (Yogurt and Cucumber Dip)",
  "description": "Drain low-fat yogurt to make this yummy yummy tzatziki sauce (yogurt and cucumber dip) recipe. Top grilled chicken or eat as a dip for veggies and pita chips.",
